beaglemem implements the BEAGLE algorithm from:
  Jones, M.N. & Mewhort, D.J.K. (2007). Representing word meaning and order
  information in a composite holographic lexicon. Psychological Review 114(1).
and builds on Dynamically Structured Holographic Memory:
  Rutledge-Taylor, M.F., Kelly, M.A., West, R.L., & Pyke, A.A. (2014).
  Dynamically structured holographic memory. Biologically Inspired Cognitive
  Architectures 9:9-32.
Reciprocal Rank Fusion: Cormack, Clarke & Buettcher (2009), SIGIR.
